    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d529">

                <pb facs="0703" n="609" xml:id="pg609"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">871.6363/176: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Rumania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Jay</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bucharest</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-06-29T21:00:00+01:44"><hi rendition="#italic">June 29, 1924—9
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received June 30—3:49
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>27. Parliament has just passed mining bill. The bill now remains to be signed by
                    the King. Will report fully by mail.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jay</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
